  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Dog Attitude is a boarding kennel for dogs, cats and ferrets at 454 chemin de l'Oratoire in Mougins, on a family-run 3-hectare wooded estate with access to the Mougins departmental park. Your dog can stay in a kennel (a shaded, ventilated kennel with a 30 sqm run and quick-drying pressure-sore-proof flooring), in a shaded 500 sqm park where each dog has its own kennel and an insulated hard shelter, or on a mixed formula (day in the park, night in the kennel). Shared accommodation is with a sociable dog of the opposite sex and a compatible size and temperament; the kennel states that zero bite risk does not exist in a shared park or kennel and declines all liability for bites.</p>
      <p>The establishment falls under the classified installations regulations (ICPE). It has dedicated quarantine and infirmary areas, security airlocks, security cameras and escape-prevention features, and a vet is about 1 km away. Dog Attitude also breeds (German shepherds and Malinois) and trains, and takes in cats and ferrets.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you book</h2>
      <p>Published rates, per day for a sociable dog: €19 in a kennel, €22 in a park (€24 from 01/12/2026), €27 on the mixed formula; for two dogs, €35 in a kennel, €40 in a park, €54 mixed, with a full grid up to 6 dogs on the website. Rates are reduced for several dogs in kennel and park, but not on the mixed formula. For a dog housed alone because it is not sociable, off-season: park €28 (€30 from 01/12/2026), kennel €25; in high season (1 July to 5 September and 15 December to 5 January inclusive): park €40, kennel €35. Kennel heating is optional at €6 per day, and a €4 per day fee applies for treatments given twice a day or more. Grooming is available on request: €30 (small dog and 20 kg dog), €40 (over 30 kg), €50 (over 40 kg).</p>
      <p>For reactive, escape-prone or destructive dogs, a Safety kennel is offered at €26 per day after an on-site assessment with you; a €6 per day supplement applies if reactivity towards people needs special handling, raised to €12 only for distinct constraints. Category 1 dogs are accepted: a dog not declared at the town hall must first take a course to obtain the ownership permit. A bitch in heat is not automatically placed in a shared formula.</p>
      <p>DHPPiL and kennel cough vaccines must be up to date, with proof sent at least 8 days before arrival and the original health record brought on drop-off day. You can bring your dog's usual food, with quantities and meal times. New customers go through an online pre-booking, then validated by the kennel. Reception by appointment only: drop-off from 8am and before 4pm, pick-up from 8am and before 5pm, never on Sundays or public holidays. Contact is by message, except in an emergency.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: choose the formula to match your dog's lifestyle, as the kennel suggests: kennel if it lives in a flat, park if it lives in a house with a garden, mixed if it spends the day outside and sleeps indoors.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Mougins, in the Alpes-Maritimes, is close to Cannes, Antibes and Nice according to the kennel's website, and the estate gives access to the Mougins departmental park.</p>
